{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Flujo: contacto se da de baja → actualizar Supabase + confirmar baja",
    "trigger": "Webhook de Brevo — evento 'unsubscribed'",
    "actions": [
      "1. Recibe evento unsubscribed de Brevo",
      "2. Actualiza status='unsubscribed' en Supabase — inmediato, sin delay",
      "3. Cancela cualquier secuencia activa en Brevo (in_active_sequence)",
      "4. Registra evento unsubscribed en email_events",
      "5. Opcional: notificar a Cristina/cliente si el volumen de bajas supera el umbral"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "CRÍTICO: este flujo debe estar activo antes de enviar el primer email.",
      "El contacto con status='unsubscribed' NUNCA vuelve a recibir emails de marketing.",
      "Para re-suscribirse, el contacto debe pasar por un nuevo doble opt-in.",
      "Brevo gestiona automáticamente la supresión en su plataforma. Este flujo actualiza Supabase para mantener la consistencia."
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "brevo-unsubscribe-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook — Brevo unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "brevo-events"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "filter-unsubscribe-event",
      "name": "Filter — Solo procesar unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [{ "value1": "={{$json.event}}", "operation": "equal", "value2": "unsubscribed" }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update-contact-unsubscribed",
      "name": "Supabase — Actualizar status=unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "contacts",
        "filterType": "string",
        "filterString": "client_id=eq.{{$env.CLIENT_ID}}&email=eq.{{$json.email}}",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "unsubscribed" },
            { "fieldId": "in_active_sequence", "fieldValue": null }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-unsubscribe-event",
      "name": "Supabase — Registrar evento unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "email_events",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "client_id", "fieldValue": "={{$env.CLIENT_ID}}" },
            { "fieldId": "email", "fieldValue": "={{$json.email}}" },
            { "fieldId": "event_type", "fieldValue": "unsubscribed" }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "brevo-unsubscribe-webhook": { "main": [["filter-unsubscribe-event"]] },
    "filter-unsubscribe-event": { "main": [["update-contact-unsubscribed"]] },
    "update-contact-unsubscribed": { "main": [["log-unsubscribe-event"]] }
  }
}
